{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼，要買什麼呢～」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1565", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃，是我要買吧？」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不管啦總之閉嘴跟我來。你只要負責付錢就好。」", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1566", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「為什麼會這樣啊……」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "休業式結束後，我依約定跟紗凪來到商場。", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "目的是買送給美羽學姊的聖誕禮物。", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……應該是這樣的，但她看起來完全是打算買自己想要的東西。", "text_idx": 159, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔啊～好想要這個黑貓的抱枕～」", "text_idx": 173, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1567", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這個跟新吾很像對吧？啊，我是說貓咪新吾喔，貓咪。」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1568", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「先讓我確認一下，我們是來買送給美羽學姊的禮物對吧？」", "text_idx": 170, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊呀～這個玩偶也好可愛～黑貓跟白貓，也有一組的……嗯嗯嗯。」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1569", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不行，她完全被自己的物慾驅使。", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過，我也想不出來買什麼東西會讓學姊高興。", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以學姊的個性，不管送她什麼都會高興的吧。", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過，情侶還真多呢，這個時期……」", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1570", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「畢竟聖誕節快到了。」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「該不會我們看起來也像情侶？」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1571", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不管怎麼看，都是感情好的同學吧。」", "text_idx": 164, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是那樣沒錯啦。」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1572", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～～～～」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1573", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳在煩惱要買什麼嗎？」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「想要那個黑貓和白貓的玩偶。」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1574", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「給誰？」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「主要是我。」", "text_idx": 167, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1575", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好，差不多該去下一間店了……」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一直找不到該送學姊什麼禮物。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "外面天色也暗了，要認真思考才行。", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是說，你自己沒有想要送什麼東西嗎？」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1576", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這個嘛……戒指之類的？」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「笨蛋，那個還太早了啦！乾脆送塞了一堆糖果的襪子算了！」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1577", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「又不是小孩子了……」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「總之，戒指不行。完全不行。」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1578", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，可以的話想送能隨身攜帶的東西。」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，能隨身攜帶嗎……」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1579", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "紗凪很不捨地把貓咪玩偶放回架上，環顧賣場。", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，這個票卡夾怎麼樣？而且畢業後，學姊搭電車的機會應該會變多。」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1580", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「票卡夾嗎……好像不錯。還可以放我的照片進去……」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不行。」", "text_idx": 165, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1581", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「開玩笑的啦，貓咪的設計也很可愛，這個好像很不錯。」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 160, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1582", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就買那個吧。要請店員包成送禮用的包裝喔。」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1583", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，還有這個白貓和黑貓的玩偶是吧？」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1584", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感謝妳陪我選禮物。」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「笨、笨蛋！那樣做的話，美羽學姊會傷心的吧！」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1585", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「會嗎？如果學姊在這裡，她應該會做和我一樣的事情吧？」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 160, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1586", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒關係的，我不會讓那個人傷心。」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……約好了喔。」", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1587", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。」", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天謝謝妳，幫了我很大的忙。」", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也得到想要的玩偶，滿足了。」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1588", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這麼多東西拿得動嗎？」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「至今為止，我都抱著像你一樣礙事的東西進行社團活動，這點程度不算什麼。」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1589", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那真是失敬了。」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我要回家了。新吾跟美羽都肚子餓了在等我吧。」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 221, "voice": "sn1590", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_20.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「給牠們最美味的貓罐頭吧。」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 219, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
